docs/vision-v3/r1-concepts/R1-SYNTHESIS.md:69:| **Mission** | C3/C4 | The unit of funded work. Its **shape is chosen per mission** — solo, lead+workers, swarm, audition/tournament — because R0-A shows no shape wins everywhere. |
docs/vision-v3/r1-concepts/R1-SYNTHESIS.md:75:| **Lease / receipt / effect gateway** | C3 | Fenced leases stop stale workers; every outside-world effect passes one gateway (idempotent, budget- and policy-checked) and leaves a receipt. |
docs/vision-v3/r1-concepts/R1-SYNTHESIS.md:84:## 4. Resolved conflicts (binding for Round 2 unless challenged upward)
docs/vision-v3/r1-concepts/R1-SYNTHESIS.md:95:7. **No span-of-control caps borrowed from humans** (R0-B). Fan-out is limited by verifier capacity (R0-A: MAST, 17.2× vs
docs/vision-v3/r1-concepts/R1-SYNTHESIS.md:96:   4.4× error amplification), not by a number of reports.
