docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-E-self-improving-codex.md:1:# R0 — Self-improving, open-ended and evaluated agents (Codex seat)
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-E-self-improving-codex.md:5:## 1) Findings with sources
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-E-self-improving-codex.md:28:## 2) What reliably improves agent outcomes
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-E-self-improving-codex.md:36:**Debate — conditional evidence, not a default advantage.** In an information-asymmetry experiment, debate raised weaker-model accuracy from **48% to 76%** and human accuracy from **60% to 88%**. Conversely, a seven-benchmark study found majority voting explained most gains attributed to multi-agent debate. Test debate against independent answers plus selection at comparable cost. [Positive experiment](https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.06782), [Debate versus voting](https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.17536).
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-E-self-improving-codex.md:42:## 3) What does not work / known failure modes
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-E-self-improving-codex.md:52:## 4) “What we should use”
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-E-self-improving-codex.md:62:4. **Equal Claude Code and Codex participation.** Either can originate hypotheses, execute, review or redesign a team. Compare complete configurations on the same tasks and budgets; do not assign permanent provider hierarchies.
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-E-self-improving-codex.md:82:14. **Cost per accepted outcome.** Include inference, retries, evaluation, experiment compute, founder attention and rework. Compare quality–cost curves rather than buying the largest swarm by default.
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-E-self-improving-codex.md:90:## 5) Ideas nobody is doing yet
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-E-self-improving-codex.md:108:## 6) Where this hits the founder’s direction
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-E-self-improving-codex.md:110:Read after outward research: the founder explicitly requires open-ended missions, equal Claude/Codex workers, dynamic specialties, useful memory, measured weekly improvement and a venture digital twin. [Founder direction](/Users/adamks/VibeCoding/agentvibe/.worktrees/ceo-2-1790613501/docs/vision-v3/00-FOUNDER-DIRECTION.md).
