docs/vision-system/planning/02-architecture-selection.md:5:The selected logical architecture is **a common authority for admitted work and surviving obligations, specialized native production, and separately protected consequence, evidence, and recovery boundaries**. Its version is **S1.0** (**S1** below), a logical specification anchor, not released software. Its organizing control is A-derived: one company case authority admits and maintains discretionary work under endorsed priorities. It incorporates the repaired responsibility and enforcement contracts, including native outcome sponsorship and independent challenge. It does not make a blackboard, distributed issuers, permanent agents, or compulsory independent discretionary inquiry jurisdiction foundational.
docs/vision-system/planning/02-architecture-selection.md:11:The [directive](../inputs/directive-contract.json), [understanding](01-understand.md), and [source vision](../inputs/THE-VISION-AND-THE-FIELDS.md) define success: one responsible person or a small founding team directs complete discovery, production, commerce, operation, learning, and closure beyond what they can personally perform or inspect. Intent, counterparty standing, truthful uncertainty, consequence-based authority, finite attention and governing competence are constraints. The historical account-only thesis, old roster and template stack do not determine the architecture.
docs/vision-system/planning/02-architecture-selection.md:17:The [cross-lane comparison](../research/cross-lane-comparison.json) preserves ten unresolved axes. S1 resolves their organizing choices without pretending to resolve their empirical unknowns. Shared intent/obligation contracts address X01; native production and actual service acceptance address X02; common case control resolves X03 provisionally; selective mappings and validity address X04/X09; independent interpretation addresses X05; ordered release and durable recovery address X06; fixed participation with competent assistance addresses X07; separate resource accounts and full closure costs address X08; bounded, removable improvement addresses X10.
