docs/vision-system/research/L14-novel.md:49:The distinctive extension is a conservation rule for responsibility: decomposition, delegation, cancellation, and company shutdown must account for every affected obligation through fulfillment, authorized transfer, release, or a surviving unresolved obligation. No mathematical conservation of monetary value is claimed. Some duties arise without bilateral promises, and some persist despite agreement; their applicable authority must be separately identified and professionally resolved where needed.
docs/vision-system/research/L14-novel.md:79:Useful mechanisms include protected closure resources, surviving obligations after cancellation, counterparty contestability, and independent owner transfer tests. Reject magical additions: a universal company digital twin, artificial consensus as stakeholder assent, automatic moral valuation of consequences, and extra agents as proof of independent evidence. Ashby's [1956 formal treatment of requisite variety, chapter 11](https://ashby.info/Ashby-Introduction-to-Cybernetics.pdf) supplies no numerical formula for one founder's cognitive capacity; translating it into one would be an unsupported inference.
docs/vision-system/research/L08-reliability.md:15:**F2 — Exactly-once claims require a cooperating effect boundary. [SC]** RIFL couples operation effects atomically with durable completion records, migrates them together, and uses leases to prevent retries after completion records are discarded. Its RAMCloud implementation establishes feasibility under those assumptions, not universal exactly-once behavior for third-party tools. An outbox atomically records a local change and the intent to publish, but its delivery may duplicate. Stripe documents pruning idempotency keys after at least 24 hours, with a reused pruned key treated as a new request. [RIFL, §§3–4](https://web.stanford.edu/~ouster/cgi-bin/papers/rifl.pdf), [AWS outbox](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/cloud-design-patterns/transactional-outbox.html), [Stripe](https://docs.stripe.com/api/idempotent_requests).
docs/vision-system/research/L08-reliability.md:23:**F4 — Liveness detection is weaker than exclusive authority. [SC]** Redis's own locking documentation calls for fencing tokens and warns that wall-clock shifts can undermine TTL-based exclusivity. PostgreSQL requires preventing a recovered former primary from continuing as primary after failover. [Redis](https://redis.io/docs/latest/develop/clients/patterns/distributed-locks/), [PostgreSQL failover](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/warm-standby-failover.html).
docs/vision-system/research/L08-reliability.md:25:**[I/P]** A worker may heartbeat while looping, or wake after its lease expires and another worker takes over. Track meaningful progress separately; require the resource accepting a write to reject obsolete execution epochs or stale versions. A token recorded only in the coordinator cannot fence an external endpoint that ignores it. Concurrency must be scoped to the actual shared resource—customer, account, budget, document—not merely task identity. Isolation limits damage between ventures; it does not resolve shared-account conflicts. Reopen whenever a write bypasses the enforcing boundary.
docs/vision-system/planning/specification/07-integrations-capacity.md:61:**SPECIFICATION.** Public applications are already released continuing programs. Their admitted profile specifies customer data, bounded actions, retention, actor authentication and provider limits; it cannot receive company payment/admin/model credentials. Product-originated payments route to provider-hosted Checkout configured from admitted offers. New product capabilities, secrets, destinations or paid bindings require protected release. Each deployed version is an AccessDescendant with stop/removal/native-status and data-export obligations; G's deployment-request cutoff does not instantly stop a program already running at Cloudflare. Pause sale, disable relevant routes, reconcile continuing sessions and notify affected people under the domain procedure.
docs/vision-system/planning/specification/07-integrations-capacity.md:83:**SOURCE CLAIM.** These are intended launch contracts grounded in [N01](../../research/implementation/N01-native-execution.md), [Claude CLI reference](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/cli-reference), [headless operation](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/headless), [Codex noninteractive use](https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/non-interactive-mode) and [Codex permissions](https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/permissions). Documentation/help inspection supports a feasible route; it does not establish that the flag combinations or isolation already pass. Exact parser flags are tested against the pinned binaries before admission; unknown flags or effective configuration differences stop launch. No API-key or credit fallback, automatic provider login change or upgrade download occurs during a job.
docs/vision-system/planning/specification/07-integrations-capacity.md:85:**SPECIFICATION.** Before launch, AuthAttestation is an Observation with actual native auth-status evidence, account/plan identity, permitted usage, expiry, installed/config digest, billing UI/API observations, API-key override absence and approved credit settings. Native status alone cannot establish remaining allowance or disabled extra billing. Claude usage/billing UI observations are supplied through an authenticated custodian; no scraping undocumented quota endpoints. Codex account/read and account/rateLimits/read may provide documented observations through app-server; use only fields actually supplied and distinguish credits from subscription limits. [App-server interface](https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/app-server), [usage limits](https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/enterprise/usage-limits), [Claude API-key precedence](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/12304248-manage-api-key-environment-variables-in-claude-code). Missing or stale billing evidence stops new launches; observed quota reset never renews the company causal budget.
docs/vision-system/planning/reviews/F2-07-outside-review.md:9:**If changing one thing:** make admission to each construction/operating scope depend on a demonstrably executable, useful end-to-end case, with the exact relevant unresolved criteria and human prerequisites listed. Pair the earliest internal case with the existing S0 comparator before funding broad construction. Preserve the complete-company target; distinguish an early discriminator from a production release or a smaller final mandate.
docs/vision-system/planning/reviews/F2-07-outside-review.md:11:Navigation: [scope and evidence](#scope-and-evidence), [reconstruction](#reconstruction-and-responsibilities), [alternatives](#consequential-alternatives), [first release](#minimum-first-release), [founder decisions](#founder-decision-packet), [dimensions](#independent-quality-dimensions), [review limitations](#review-limitations). Findings, independent verifications, chapter-ordered repairs and exhaustive source indexes follow.
