docs/vision-system/planning/reviews/D2-architecture-evidence-company.md:7:**Verdict:** The amendments close EAS-01–04 conceptually. C2 now establishes a meaningful alternative on governing authority: admissible inquiries acquire bounded execution and continuity rights that ordinary production prioritization cannot cancel. That distinction does not depend on blackboard technology and establishes no performance advantage.
