docs/vision-system/planning/candidates/B-federated-responsibility.md:11:A small exchange delivers messages and builds inspectable accounts. It cannot award work, grant permissions, discharge obligations, or interpret arbitrary workflows. A request's accountable sponsor selects its recipient; that recipient chooses its internal method. Domain-specific custodians enforce scarce-resource limits. The owner sets purpose and limits and arbitrates genuinely unresolved choices within their standing. A counterparty can contest fulfillment even after internal acceptance.
docs/vision-system/planning/candidates/B-federated-responsibility.md:23:| Obligation | Debtor, creditor or affected party, basis, original terms, contested interpretations, duty custodian, deadline, discharge rule, and resources needed to finish or close. Asserted → recognized/disputed → performed → discharged, released, transferred, or surviving. An internal cancellation never implies release. |
docs/vision-system/planning/candidates/B-federated-responsibility.md:40:Conflicting edits are mediated at the resource that accepts writes: native conditional updates or a single authorized write endpoint with version checks. Worktrees isolate code drafts; accepted revisions still need merge conflict resolution. If a native service offers neither conditional updates nor exclusive controllable credentials, automation may draft against it but cannot perform conflicting consequential writes. A lease recorded only in the exchange would not fence that service. This follows the limitation identified in [L08](../../research/L08-reliability.md).
docs/vision-system/planning/PLANNING-REPORT.md:79:**The lanes were then compared without forcing agreement.** [cross-lane-comparison.md](../research/F2/cross-lane-comparison.md) records 18 agreements, **16 disagreements preserved rather than resolved**, ten existing axes reconciled, ten new ones, and 41 of 65 cross-lane questions still open. It examined **14 falsifier candidates against the six boundaries the round was told to treat as fixed and returned zero** (§E) — so nothing licensed reopening the consequence and release boundary, evidence and acceptance, recovery, human responsibility, the founder-competence mechanism or whole-company scope.
docs/vision-system/planning/PLANNING-REPORT.md:131:| **The consequence class is computed from records the acting party cannot author** — resolved parameters, the destination and egress identity, open obligations and the owning capability's declared floor — and recomputed at the moment of release on the frozen bytes. A mismatch parks and never resolves downward. The derivation returns the **set** of classes reached and every reached class's gates apply; no rank is computed | [AD-016](../registers/decisions.json) |
docs/vision-system/planning/PLANNING-REPORT.md:136:| **Standing accountability is a record with an address and a reservation.** A holder is proposed by the capability owner and endorsed; it never produces, never releases, never decides a matter it is the subject of, and **carries no model memory**. Every acceptance-owner role carries a reachability route, a capacity reservation, an alternate and a review date | [AD-021](../registers/decisions.json) · [05 §12](specification/05-work-agents-skills.md) |
